[TITLE]
CRASH-13: J1 -> C1 -> O1 with two pollutants (P1 = index 0, P2 = index 1).
The test only opens the project and calls the pollutant flux setters before
swmm_start.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             01:00:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         30
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth SurDepth Aponded
J1     10   5   0   0   0

[OUTFALLS]
